## 3. 요청 — 자연어 한 줄
{"message":"Provision a Cloud Run service named day1-cost-demo. Then tell me: the contract id,
 the ledger entry id, the cost label that was attached to the created resource, and whether
 that cost is reconcilable against a bill."}
→ HTTP 200 · 23.06s · session request-1

## 4. 응답 — 에이전트가 라벨과 화해 가능성을 함께 냈다 (REQ-604)
